<title>UK: Stagecoach H1 pretax profit, dividend surge.</title>
<headline>Stagecoach H1 pretax profit, dividend surge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.0		   vs 9.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.0		    vs 2.1</p>
<p> Pretax		     47.0		   vs 20.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   405.1		  vs 189.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Stagecoach Holdings Plc, a rapidly-growing British-based bus and train operator, said it was confident of a successful outcome for the full-year.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 42.4		   vs 25.6</p>
<p> Exceptional gain	 15.2		   vs 0.6</p>
<p> Interest charge	  10.6		   vs 5.5</p>
<p> Tax			  13.7		   vs 6.0</p>
<p> Net taxed		  33.3		   vs 14.7</p>
<p> Attributable	     32.9		   vs 13.8</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 20, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Jan 14, 1997  Ex-div date		Jan 6, 1997</p>
</text>
